Runtime dependencies
--------------------
These dependencies are not bundled in the source distribution. The macOS
.lrplugin package includes Python, NumPy, image-only OpenCV and the PyInstaller
bootloader. Their license texts are included in its licenses/ directory.
OpenCV is built from unmodified 5.0.0 sources with JPEG, PNG and zlib support;
FFmpeg and its video codec dependencies are not included.

